# At the airport in Russian: паспорт, рейс
subtitle: "Get through the airport in Russian: ваш па́спорт, пожа́луйста, бага́ж and чемода́н, and рейс, вы́лет and поса́дка on the screen."
tags: ["russian","russian travel phrases","airport in russian","russian vocabulary","travel"]
teaches: ["phrases/travel-phrases","vocabulary/travel"]
thumb: "band \"The first thing they ask at the airport\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"At the hotel in Russian: у меня́ не рабо́тает душ","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/92-russian-hotel.cast"}

## At the airport in Russian: паспорт, рейс
