    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text end_say "Счастли́вого пути́! До свида́ния!" say "Счастли́вого пути́! До свида́ния!" say_voice b x 500 y 300 font_size 54 hidden true
    text end_gloss "have a good trip" #8f887c x 500 y 200 font_size 40 hidden true

A: You can already buy a ticket: биле́т в Москву́, пожа́луйста. And you know самолёт from lesson 47.
    draw o_plane o_ticket o_say

    erase o_plane o_ticket o_say

A: Today the plane leaves from an аэропо́рт, and Tom is flying to Moscow.
    draw dep aero

A: Я в аэропорту́.
    draw v_aero

A: At the airport is в аэропорту́: a stressed у, not е. A few words do that.
    highlight v_aero color #5b8c5a part у́$ effect underline

    erase dep aero v_aero

A: At the desk, the first thing they want is your па́спорт.
    draw pass pasp

B: Ваш па́спорт, пожа́луйста.
    draw vash

A: Ваш is (@draw moi_vash@) your, when you (@highlight vash color #5b8c5a part ^Ваш effect underline@) say вы: мой for я, ваш for вы.

B: Or, with покажи́те: покажи́те, пожа́луйста, ваш па́спорт.
    draw pokaz

    erase pass pasp vash moi_vash pokaz

B: У вас есть бага́ж?
    draw bag q_bag

A: Бага́ж is your luggage. (@draw bagazh@) At the end of a word, ж sounds like ш: бага́ж.

A: Да, оди́н чемода́н. A чемода́н is a suitcase.
    draw a_bag

    erase bag q_bag bagazh a_bag

A: Now you. Which one is бага́ж?
    draw c_word c_pass c_ticket c_bag

    erase c_word

    ask "Which picture is бага́ж? Tap it." choose ["c_pass","c_ticket","c_bag"] answer c_bag pool false
        right: The suitcase: бага́ж, оди́н чемода́н.
        wrong: Бага́ж is luggage: the suitcase.

    erase c_pass c_ticket c_bag

A: Now the screen. Рейс is a flight: рейс в Москву́.
    draw board bd_reis

A: Вы́лет is the departure, when the plane leaves: вы́лет в де́сять.
    draw bd_vylet

A: And поса́дка is boarding, when you get on.
    draw bd_pos

B: Поса́дка начина́ется в де́вять.
    draw pos_say

A: Начина́ется, with its ся, as in уро́к начина́ется: boarding starts.
    highlight pos_say color #7a5aa8 part ся$ effect underline

A: It's eight now, so boarding starts in an hour:
    draw clock8

B: Поса́дка начина́ется че́рез час.
    draw pos_cherez

    erase board bd_reis bd_vylet bd_pos pos_say clock8 pos_cherez

A: Now the desk. Masha plays the woman at (@draw d_bag@) check-in. Listen; then tap Practise after the dialogue to say Tom's part.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk d_bag

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Nine o'clock, at the gate. Now a longer listen, with no words on screen.
    draw ear

A: Извини́те, поса́дка уже́ начина́ется?
    draw l_man caption false

B: Нет. Вы́лет не в де́сять, а в оди́ннадцать.
    draw l_woman caption false

A: А когда́ поса́дка?
    caption false

    ask "When does boarding start?" voice b options ["at nine","in an hour","at eleven"] correct 2 reveal.text "че́рез час" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        listen: Поса́дка начина́ется че́рез час.
        right: In an hour: че́рез час.
        wrong: Listen after начина́ется: че́рез час, in an hour.

    erase ear l_man l_woman

A: Here is all of it. The flight is late: вы́лет at eleven now, so boarding is at ten.
    draw l1 l2 l3 l4

    erase l1 l2 l3 l4

    draw q_dep

    quiz "On the airport screen: вы́лет 10:00. What happens at ten?" reveal.text "вы́лет: the plane leaves" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Вы́лет is the departure: the plane leaves at ten.
        wrong: Вы́лет is the departure. Boarding is поса́дка.
        + The plane leaves.
        * Boarding starts.
        * The plane lands.

    erase q_dep

    draw q_clock

    quiz "Boarding starts in an hour: Поса́дка начина́ется ___." above q_clock reveal.text "че́рез час" reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Че́рез час: in an hour from now.
        wrong: В час is at one o'clock, and час наза́д is an hour ago.
        * в час
        * час наза́д
        + че́рез час

    erase q_clock

    draw q_dep

    quiz "Speaking to a passenger: Вы ___ быть тут в де́вять." reveal.text "Вы должны́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Должны́: with вы, it's always должны́.
        wrong: До́лжен and должна́ go with он and она́. With вы, должны́.
        * до́лжен
        + должны́
        * должна́

A: Вы должны́ быть тут в де́вять.
    draw q_must

    erase q_dep q_must

    draw q_pass

    ask say_it "Вот мой па́спорт и биле́т." gloss "Here's my passport and ticket." voice a show cue reveal.text "Вот мой па́спорт и биле́т." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1

    erase q_pass

    draw q_dep

    ask "Now build a question. Type: When does boarding start?" answer ["когда начинается посадка","когда посадка начинается","а когда начинается посадка","когда будет посадка"] voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Когда́ начина́ется поса́дка? Когда́ first, then the verb with ся.
        wrong: Когда́, then начина́ется, then поса́дка.

B: Когда́ начина́ется поса́дка?
    draw q_full

    erase q_dep q_full

    draw q_dep

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase q_dep

A: So at the airport: ваш па́спорт at the (@highlight b1 b2 color #5b8c5a effect underline@) desk, бага́ж and чемода́н for your bags, (@highlight b3 b4 color #5b8c5a effect underline@) and рейс, вы́лет and поса́дка on the screen.
    draw sum

    erase sum

B: Счастли́вого пути́! До свида́ния!
    draw end_masha end_say

A: Счастли́вого пути́ is have (@draw end_gloss@) a good trip: the last thing the woman at the desk says.
    highlight end_say color #5b8c5a effect underline part "^Счастли́вого пути́"

    erase end_masha end_say end_gloss

A: Next time: Tom lands, and checks in at the гости́ница.
    box next92 "Next: lesson 92 · гости́ница" x 500 y 430 width 700 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

